    "detailed_description": "<h1>Purchase Notice</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who have bought Sexy Beats, please note that this game is the same work, only some characters are different. If you cannot accept it, please do not buy it. Thank you.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226190/extras/8420ca881788ccd76ec61bc364fca7ae.poster.avif?t=1751160243\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226190/extras/8420ca881788ccd76ec61bc364fca7ae.webm?t=1751160243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226190/extras/8420ca881788ccd76ec61bc364fca7ae.mp4?t=1751160243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Erotic Rhythm&quot; is an addictive and sexy rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple operation, beautiful songs and attractive girls to bring you a dreamy flow experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just hit the notes accurately and the girl will swing her body to the music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u266a 10 Erotic animated CGs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Girls in the cgs will react to the game beats by swing their bodies and even take off clothes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226190/extras/9de078a8ff0bb432e86798248c07cb15.poster.avif?t=1751160243\" width=432 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3226190/extras/9de078a8ff0bb432e86798248c07cb15.webm?t=1751160243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp